Write a method named `secondLargest` that takes an `int[]` parameter `arr`, guaranteed to have at least 2 elements with no duplicate values, and returns the second-largest value in `arr`. For example, `secondLargest(new int[]{3, 9, 1, 7})` should return `7`.

Complete the method below.

```java
public int secondLargest(int[] arr) {
    /* your code here */
}
```

sampleResponse:
